  "seeds_note": "device0 and oic_res are verbatim diagnostics captures (issue #525). The /device/2 seed batch is reconstructed, not captured live: the diagnostics report only carries the subdevice's already-canonicalized resources (subdevices[0].resources), so this reindexes each trailing '.../vs/0' href to '.../vs/2' per subdevices.Subdevice.to_actual's own indexed-sibling rule, rather than recording the raw wire response. /device/1 and /multidevice/vs/0 answered nothing on the device and are left out."
